  "title": "Design Settings » Main Menu Design | Brilliant Directories Documentation | BD Support",
  "content": "Design Settings » Main Menu Design Link: https://support.brilliantdirectories.com/support/solutions/articles/12000045049 Main Menu Design This article goes over the Main Menu Design settings and how to edit the Main Menu of the website. To access this section navigate to: Settings Design Settings General Main Menu Design Visual Guide of the Main Menu Design 1. Display Main Menu This setting controls if the Main Menu of the website is displayed or not. 2. Menu Behavior The different options to choose from are: Standard Stick to Top Stick to Bottom Locked When Scrolling Standard: Stick to Top Stick to Bottom Stick to Top When Scrolling 3. Public Visitor Main Menu This setting controls the menu displayed for visitors of the website, visitors being people viewing the website without logging in. Very important to note that only the default or an exact clone of the Header Main Menu is going to work on this area. Other Menus listed on Toolbox >> Menu Manager are not going to work since these are not designed for this area. 4. Logged In Member Main Menu This setting controls the Members Main Menu, which will only be displayed when members are logged in to the website. Very important to note that only the default or an exact clone of the Header Main Menu is going to work on this area. Other Menus listed on Toolbox >> Menu Manager are not going to work since these are not designed for this area. Use this Menu option to add links just for members. 5. Menu Font Family This setting controls the Font of the Main Menu, to review the available fonts check out the following link: https://fonts.google.com/ .... 6. Menu Link Font Size This setting controls the font size in the menu, 16 px is our recommended size. 7. Menu Font Weight This setting controls the font weight in the menu: Main Menu Colors These setting control the colors of the website's Main Menu. 8. Menu Bar Background This setting controls the background color of the website's Main Menu 9. Menu Link Color This setting controls the text color for the links in the website's Main Menu. 10. Menu Link Hover Color This setting controls the hover color of the Text of the website's Main Menu 11. Drop-Down Background This setting controls the background color of the drop-down elements of the website's Main Menu 12. Drop-Down Link Color This setting controls the link color for menu elements inside the drop-down menus of the website's Main Menu 13. Drop-Down Weight This setting controls the weight of the text for menu elements inside the drop-down menus of the website's Main Menu For additional assistance: Email support@brilliantdirectories.com or create a ticket Inside Your Account Dashboard . Was this article helpful and accurate? Yes No Send feedback Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
